\begin{align*}
1 = \dfrac{1-e^{2025i\theta}}{1-e^{i\theta}} + \dfrac{1-e^{-2025i\theta}}{1-e^{-i\theta}} &= \dfrac{1-e^{2025i\theta}}{1-e^{i\theta}} - \dfrac{e^{i\theta}\left(1-e^{-2025i\theta}\right)}{1-e^{i\theta}} 
&= 1+\dfrac{e^{-2024i\theta}-e^{2025i\theta}}{1-e^{i\theta}}.
\end{align*}
Thus, we wish to compute all  $\theta$  such that 
\[ e^{2025i\theta}-e^{-2024i\theta} = e^{-2024i\theta} \left(e^{4049i\theta}-1\right) = 0. \]
